method:{choice:"animate_image direct loose-sprite animation, proposed bounded motion experiment",why:"Official retained declaration explicitly supports a fresh first-frame PNG and four generated frames from a16x16 loose sprite. It does not require inventing a character/object resource. Current preparation uses accepted seed bytes, never old transport handles. Four distinct quarter-turn phases express an expert attempt to reduce prior model morph/holds, without adding exact geometry to owner rejection criteria.",risk:"Prior AI animation returned a grey matte and after guarded cutout still morphed/held and jumped at wrap; exact specialist-constructed quarter-turn motion subsequently passed. Thus this proposed AI retry is lower confidence than deterministic construction and no better outcome is claimed. Retained workbench declaration exposes guarded edits but no verified direct seed-to-four-frame rotation command; do not invent unsupported recipe fields. A future deterministic route should discover the full scene/animation contract first, retain fresh source input and provenance, and undergo independent review.",prior_failure:"work/live-family/working-animation-repair-01-review-input.json",prior_success:"work/live-family/working-animation-motion-01-review-input.json"},
assembly:{scope:"Exact prospective assembly policy for the saved animation request only",returned:"get_image returns input index0 plus four generated frames indices1,2,3,4",retain:"Keep all five returned original PNGs and response identities/hashes unchanged.",selection:[1,2,3,4],layout:"Paste generated frames1,2,3,4 left-to-right at x0,16,32,48,y0 onto transparent64x16 RGBA canvas. No resize, resample, dropping, duplication or in-place rewrite. Reject unexpected frame geometry/cardinality and retain discrepancy; do not improvise a different selection.",timing:"100ms per selected frame,400ms loop",review:"Measure every frame and sheet; inspect actual transparent compositing at1x/3x on#172336 and exact Ready baseline; inspect activity/distinction, coherent volume and fixed placement, actual100ms playback and last-to-first seam; exercise both consumers with screenshot/source identity. Provider success or schema validity grants none of these."},
authority:[{property:"16x16 cell,4horizontal frames100ms,transparency,cool-blue accent,1x/3x readability,activity vs success",status:"requirement",source:"BRIEF.md:3; src/queue-view.ts:2-11",scope:"original authoring contract"},{property:"coherent clusters/stepped treatment, transparent exterior, no exact palette/alpha/stroke/margins",status:"scoped adopted style",source:"work/family-render-review/caller-comparison-final.json style_decision",scope:"queue family"},{property:"center7.5,7.5 quarter-turn phases and seed segment preservation",status:"specialist experimental approach",source:"current provider action and prior successful construction",scope:"provider instructions only, not extra owner rejection rules"}],
reconciliation:{observation:"AUTHORING-UPDATE.md",source_comparison:"src/queue-view.ts currently maps running to assets/working.png with frames4 and no reduced-motion descriptor or option. statusCell and compactStatus both simply return that shared descriptor. renderer/view.mjs paint derives frame=floor(max(elapsed,0)/frameMs)%frames; animate advances requestAnimationFrame for frames>1 without a prefers-reduced-motion match or preference branch. Therefore the new stationary Working route is not mapped or verified by the existing code. queue.ts started still maps to running.",meaning:"New caller requirement is additive reduced-motion support, not cancellation of original normal-motion timing; reduced-motion mapping, fixed-frame choice versus dedicated stationary destination and its both-consumer behavior need explicit contract review. A stationary activity motif could satisfy the new requirement without becoming a check or pause bars, but the seed's old pose acceptance does not accept this new use.",preserved:"All original assets/sources/plar and accepted package stay unchanged. New animation-only plan and exact prepared request retained as history; not relabeled current or failed provider execution.",can_proceed:"Read-only/local contract and consumer comparison; Retry and Paused selections remain current locally, but this assignment authorizes no more requests. Collective delivery waits for all prospective members and revised mapping.",cannot_proceed:"Dispatch old Working request, create another pending Working request, claim reduced-motion acceptance, regenerate or overwrite originals.",next:"Caller independently compare exact old plan/request and current update; then separately review stationary Working mapping for both consumers, destination/frame policy, visual distinction and live reduced-motion tests. Resolve retained prepared intent under existing lifecycle before a separately assigned revised plan/request. No remote generation in this task."},
job_status:{state:job.state,remote_id:job.remote_id,events:job.events,blockers:job.blockers,next_action:job.next_action},remote_execution:false,new_art_acceptance:false,caller_actions:["Complete independent comparison against source assignment and exact packet bytes; report method risk rather than assuming AI retry superiority.","Populate AUTHORING-RESULT.json with exact hashes and current status."],future_work:["Consumer/contract review of reduced-motion stationary Working route, preserve normal-mode behavior, resolve existing prepared intent before new request."]};
